FP5A - free 0.5 um 5 V research PDK

This repository contains:
  * Original FP5A models, decks, documentation and scripts.
  * OSU 0.5 um standard-cell views derived from the qflow project.
    The qflow/OSU files retain their original copyright and license terms;
    see the qflow project for details.
  * Public MOSIS parametric data used as a reference. No confidential
    foundry data is included.

